    "root": {
      "id": "06931252-49b2-4e73-af3c-74630d4e4a86",
      "text": "List.map_comp_map",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
          "text": "中心概念：列表与拼接",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "3f7478f5-fece-4c8a-829e-98afde13a673",
              "text": "List.map_comp_map",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 目标\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.List.Basic`\n\n**角色** 目标定理\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {β : Type v} {γ : Type w} (g : β → γ) (f : α → β), List.map g ∘ List.map f = List.map (g ∘ f)\n```\n\n**文档**\nComposing a `List.map` with another `List.map` is equal to\na single `List.map` of composed functions.",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "目标",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#2563eb",
                "color": "#ffffff",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
                "shape": "round",
                "borderColor": "#1e40af",
                "borderWidth": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ac015c1d-5cd4-48bd-ac1b-fdb5f42cb9e3",
              "text": "[陈述] List",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nLinked lists: ordered lists, in which each element has a reference to the next element.\n\nMost operations on linked lists take time proportional to the length of the list, because each\nelement must be traversed to find the next element.\n\n`List α` is isomorphic to `Array α`, but they are useful for different things:\n* `List α` is easier for reasoning, and `Array α` is modeled as a wrapper around `List α`.\n* `List α` works well as a persistent data structure, when many copies of the tail are shared. When\n  the value is not shared, `Array α` will have better performance because it can do destructive\n  updates.",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "陈述",
                  "inductive"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f8fbff",
                "color": "#1e3a8a",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "100cbd40-831d-4a4b-882a-bb47e815343c",
              "text": "[证明] List.comp_map",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.List.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {β : Type v} {γ : Type w} (h : β → γ) (g : α → β) (l : List α), List.map (h ∘ g) l = List.map h (List.map g l)\n```\n\n**文档**\nA single `List.map` of a composition of functions is equal to\ncomposing a `List.map` with another `List.map`, fully applied.\nThis is the reverse direction of `List.map_map`.",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f7fef9",
                "color": "#14532d",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#86efac"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "f709c07a-25b4-4106-88d0-193c5f485ff7",
              "text": "[证明] List.ext_getElem?",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.List.Lemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} {l₁ l₂ : List α}, (∀ (i : ℕ), l₁[i]? = l₂[i]?) → l₁ = l₂\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f7fef9",
                "color": "#14532d",
