                "borderColor": "#86efac"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "8511e9d3-aa69-4e4a-9fd2-d2132079754d",
              "text": "[证明] List.length",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → List α → ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe length of a list.\n\nThis function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`, which uses constant stack space.\n\nExamples:\n* `([] : List String).length = 0`\n* `[\"green\", \"brown\"].length = 2`",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "definition"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f7fef9",
                "color": "#14532d",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#86efac"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "5663b425-b5d9-4077-982e-1023237aeaae",
              "text": "[陈述] List.map",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → {β : Type u_2} → (α → β) → List α → List β\n```\n\n**文档**\nApplies a function to each element of the list, returning the resulting list of values.\n\n`O(|l|)`.\n\nExamples:\n* `[a, b, c].map f = [f a, f b, f c]`\n* `[].map Nat.succ = []`\n* `[\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"].map (·.length) = [3, 3, 5]`\n* `[\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"].map (·.reverse) = [\"eno\", \"owt\", \"eerht\"]`",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "陈述",
                  "definition"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f8fbff",
                "color": "#1e3a8a",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "2c08d3dc-696f-494f-8e15-4dd9b0af0b8b",
              "text": "[证明] List.map_map",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "6927718d-ab42-4c2e-a7f3-55443fdbe11b",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.List.Lemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {β : Type u_1} {γ : Type u_2} {α : Type u_3} {g : β → γ} {f : α → β} {l : List α}, List.map g (List.map f l) = List.map (g ∘ f) l\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f7fef9",
                "color": "#14532d",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#86efac"
              }
            }
          ],
          "isExpanded": true,
          "parentId": "06931252-49b2-4e73-af3c-74630d4e4a86",
          "data": {
            "note": "**概念** 列表与拼接（List / ++ / length）\n\n**锚点** 7 个\n\n**概念依赖（聚焦内）**\n- 等式与同余（Eq / congr）：type 4 / proof 7\n- 函数与复合（Function / ∘）：type 3 / proof 4\n- 元素访问（GetElem? / getElem?）：type 1 / proof 2\n- 实例/类型类机器（instances）：type 2 / proof 4\n- 内部管道（equation compiler / recursor / match）：type 0 / proof 7\n- 逻辑与函数外延（True / Iff / propext / funext）：type 0 / proof 3\n- 自然数与加法（Nat / +）：type 2 / proof 3\n- Option 与可空值：type 1 / proof 4\n- 序关系（LT / LE）：type 1 / proof 2",
            "tags": [
              "concept",
              "list",
              "中心"
            ]
          },
          "style": {
            "background": "#dbeafe",
            "color": "#1e3a8a",
            "fontWeight": "bold",
