                "borderColor": "#60a5fa"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c0adf42b-bce1-4121-bba7-c69be5c09174",
              "text": "函数与复合",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "7ea7f1f9-dafb-4c17-b47e-5b9b54e9689d",
                  "text": "[陈述] Function.comp",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "c0adf42b-bce1-4121-bba7-c69be5c09174",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Sort u} → {β : Sort v} → {δ : Sort w} → (β → δ) → (α → β) → α → δ\n```\n\n**文档**\nFunction composition, usually written with the infix operator `∘`. A new function is created from\ntwo existing functions, where one function's output is used as input to the other.\n\nExamples:\n * `Function.comp List.reverse (List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`\n * `(List.reverse ∘ List.drop 2) [3, 2, 4, 1] = [1, 4]`",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "49aafd16-434a-429b-8a57-01a3a82e3b1c",
                  "text": "[证明] Function.comp_apply",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "c0adf42b-bce1-4121-bba7-c69be5c09174",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Core`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {β : Sort u_1} {δ : Sort u_2} {α : Sort u_3} {f : β → δ} {g : α → β} {x : α}, (f ∘ g) x = f (g x)\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
