                {
                  "id": "5d57bb54-6477-49ed-852d-54ad1e5fb255",
                  "text": "[证明] funext",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "204aff98-5fd6-45fd-b7c0-8a53a7d07243",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Core`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Sort u} {β : α → Sort v} {f g : (x : α) → β x}, (∀ (x : α), f x = g x) → f = g\n```\n\n**文档**\n**Function extensionality.** If two functions return equal results for all possible arguments, then\nthey are equal.\n\nIt is called “extensionality” because it provides a way to prove two objects equal based on the\nproperties of the underlying mathematical functions, rather than based on the syntax used to denote\nthem. Function extensionality is a theorem that can be [proved using quotient\ntypes](lean-manual://section/quotient-funext).",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "060b3111-9060-4193-8bca-1229aee36202",
              "data": {
                "note": "**概念** 逻辑与函数外延（True / Iff / propext / funext）\n\n**锚点** 6 个\n\n**概念依赖（聚焦内）**\n- 等式与同余（Eq / congr）：type 1 / proof 2\n- 内部管道（equation compiler / recursor / match）：type 0 / proof 1\n- 商类型（Quot）：type 0 / proof 4",
                "tags": [
                  "concept",
                  "logic"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f0fdf4",
                "color": "#166534",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
                "shape": "round",
                "borderColor": "#34d399"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "14add4a3-9ad2-44a9-b2ad-49dd4b8ac68f",
              "text": "Option 与可空值",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "f8e7f784-f766-441b-8dd9-6269f63ee49c",
                  "text": "[证明] Option",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "14add4a3-9ad2-44a9-b2ad-49dd4b8ac68f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nOptional values, which are either `some` around a value from the underlying type or `none`.\n\n`Option` can represent nullable types or computations that might fail. In the codomain of a function\ntype, it can also represent partiality.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "inductive"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "dcdf4848-7517-43e9-9343-781605c4b19e",
                  "text": "[证明] Option.ext",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "14add4a3-9ad2-44a9-b2ad-49dd4b8ac68f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Option.Lemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} {o₁ o₂ : Option α}, (∀ (a : α), o₁ = some a ↔ o₂ = some a) → o₁ = o₂\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "3add3a4b-c9f4-434f-849c-851be69f9756",
                  "text": "[证明] Option.none",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "14add4a3-9ad2-44a9-b2ad-49dd4b8ac68f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → Option α\n```\n\n**文档**\nNo value.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
