                },
                {
                  "id": "90200007-a9f9-4582-a708-919337e948f0",
                  "text": "[证明] Option.some",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "14add4a3-9ad2-44a9-b2ad-49dd4b8ac68f",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → α → Option α\n```\n\n**文档**\nSome value of type `α`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
