                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "68fdee01-47d0-4618-9785-a43f11a902cf",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 实例\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.GetElem`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → GetElem? (List α) ℕ α fun as i => i < as.length\n```\n\n**文档**\nThis instance overrides the default implementation of `a[i]?` via `decidableGetElem?`,\ngiving better definitional equalities.\n\n**说明** 类型类实例，解释实现，不是学习先修；默认折叠。",
