                {
                  "id": "4ff5e654-73a5-4ff3-b3df-e08edb66a3f8",
                  "text": "[内部] List.ext_getElem?._f",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "0663966c-bee4-4381-85a9-0e7f2d9b6c55",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.List.Lemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} {l₁ : List α} (f : List.below (motive := fun {l₁} => ∀ {l₂ : List α}, (∀ (i : ℕ), l₁[i]? = l₂[i]?) → l₁ = l₂) l₁) {l₂ : List α}, (∀ (i : ℕ), l₁[i]? = l₂[i]?) → l₁ = l₂\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
