                {
                  "id": "b228b708-6ec8-44a0-8a80-a9891ac593d2",
                  "text": "[内部] _private.Init.Data.Option.Lemmas.0.Option.ext.match_1_1",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "0663966c-bee4-4381-85a9-0e7f2d9b6c55",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Option.Lemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} (motive : (x x_1 : Option α) → (∀ (a : α), x = some a ↔ x_1 = some a) → Prop) (x x_1 : Option α) (x_2 : ∀ (a : α), x = some a ↔ x_1 = some a), (∀ (x : ∀ (a : α), none = some a ↔ none = some a), motive none none x) → (∀ (val : α) (x : Option α) (H : ∀ (a : α), some val = some a ↔ x = some a), motive (some val) x H) → (∀ (x : Option α) (val : α) (H : ∀ (a : α), x = some a ↔ some val = some a), motive x (some val) H) → motive x x_1 x_2\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "内部",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f9fafb",
                    "color": "#6b7280",
